About the (KOxDO)F1 cross vs F2 cross, is the F2 cross more informative? I interpret your reply to indicate that the F1 cross and the F2 cross cannot be integrated in the same analysis. We have about 50 F1 progeny so far. Our target may be 3 or 4x more, so if F2 cross is more informative then now would be the time to switch. Or maybe you meant the F1 cross would give more mapping precision than the F2 cross?

Thanks so much.
Bill

